      "content": "You mentioned that the concerns about short-term economic impacts \"often overlook\" the long-term benefits. Can you go deeper into the specific arguments made by critics regarding industrial competitiveness? I want to make sure I'm not painting them as just being shortsighted—what are the most rigorous economic arguments they use to suggest this could actually harm the US economy in the long run?",
